# Type no_assembly turns the module into a per-source transform: the tool named by
# the Compiler key runs once for every source, produces no objects, and never links.
# The UI says "Transforming"/"Transform complete" instead of "Building"/"Build complete".
# `sort` exists on Windows and POSIX and exits 0, printing each source's lines sorted.
Assembly    TransformStep
Type        no_assembly

Compiler    sort

SourceFiles notes
